$L += '<p>Choosing the right custom gift depends on the recipient age. Here is how to select personalized gifts that resonate with every generation.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Kids (Ages 3-12)</h2>'
$L += '<p>Children love items featuring their favorite characters, animals, or colors. Custom t-shirts with fun designs, personalized pillows with their names, and custom blankets with playful patterns are always hits.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Teenagers (Ages 13-19)</h2>'
$L += '<p>Teens value style and self-expression. Custom phone cases, trendy t-shirts with unique designs, and personalized accessories let them showcase their personality. Social-media-worthy items are especially popular.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Young Adults (Ages 20-35)</h2>'
$L += '<p>This demographic appreciates practical yet stylish items. Custom mugs for their morning coffee routine, personalized pillows for their apartment, and custom apparel that reflects their interests and values.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Adults (Ages 36-55)</h2>'
$L += '<p>Mature adults value quality and sentiment. Custom photo blankets, personalized home decor items, and elegant custom gifts that commemorate special occasions or family memories.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Seniors (Ages 55+)</h2>'
$L += '<p>Seniors treasure family connections above all. Custom items featuring family photos, grandchildren names, memorial designs, or cozy blankets and pillows with meaningful messages make wonderful gifts.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>Age-appropriate custom gifts show that you understand and appreciate the recipient. By tailoring your personalized gift to their life stage and interests, you create something truly meaningful. Explore our <a href="../products/">full product range</a> for ideas for every age group.</p>'
