$L += '<link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/style.css"></head><body>'
$L += '<header><nav><div class="logo"><h1><a href="../index.html">CustomGiftLab</a></h1></div><ul class="nav-menu"><li><a href="../index.html">Home</a></li><li><a href="../products/">Products</a></li><li><a href="../guides/">Guides</a></li><li><a href="../blog/" class="active">Blog</a></li><li><a href="../about.html">About</a></li><li><a href="../contact.html">Contact</a></li></ul></nav></header>'
$L += '<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-content"><h1>How to Care for Your Custom Gifts</h1><p class="post-meta">April 26, 2024 | By CustomGiftLab Team</p></div></section>'
$L += '<div class="container"><article class="blog-content">'
$L += '<p>Proper care extends the life of your custom gifts. Follow these guidelines to keep your personalized items looking great for years to come.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom T-Shirt Care</h2>'
$L += '<p>Wash inside-out in cold water to protect the print. Avoid bleach and fabric softeners. Tumble dry on low or hang dry. Iron inside-out if needed, never directly on the print. These steps keep colors vibrant and prints intact.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom Mug Care</h2>'
$L += '<p>Most custom mugs are dishwasher safe, but hand washing extends print life. Avoid abrasive scrubbers. Do not microwave mugs with metallic accents. Store carefully to prevent chipping.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom Pillow Care</h2>'
$L += '<p>Remove the cover and wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Air dry or tumble dry low. Fluff regularly to maintain shape. Avoid direct sunlight for extended periods to prevent fading.</p>'
$L += '<h2>Custom Blanket Care</h2>'
$L += '<p>Machine wash cold on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry. Avoid high heat which can damage prints. Store folded in a cool, dry place when not in use.</p>'
$L += '<h2>General Tips</h2>'
$L += '<ul><li><strong>Always follow care labels:</strong> Specific products may have unique requirements.</li><li><strong>Treat stains promptly:</strong> Blot stains immediately with cold water.</li><li><strong>Store properly:</strong> Keep items in cool, dry places away from direct sunlight.</li><li><strong>Handle with care:</strong> Gentle treatment extends the life of any custom product.</li></ul>'
$L += '<h2>Conclusion</h2>'
$L += '<p>With proper care, your custom gifts will remain vibrant and meaningful for years. Follow these simple guidelines to protect your investment and keep your personalized items looking their best. Visit our <a href="../guides/">design guides</a> for more tips on creating and maintaining custom products.</p>'
$L += '</article></div></main>'
$L += '<footer><div class="footer-content"><div class="footer-section"><h3>CustomGiftLab</h3><p>Premium custom gifts for every occasion</p></div><div class="footer-section"><h4>Quick Links</h4><ul><li><a href="../products/">Products</a></li><li><a href="../guides/">Design Guides</a></li><li><a href="../blog/">Blog</a></li><li><a href="../contact.html">Contact Us</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-section"><h4>Legal</h4><ul><li><a href="../privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a href="../terms-of-service.html">Terms of Service</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><p>(c) 2026 CustomGiftLab. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer>'
